<title>DUBAI: DUBAI TENNIS OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>DUBAI TENNIS OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in  the $1</p>
<p>million Dubai Open men's tournament on Tuesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Lars Jonsson (Sweden) 6-4</p>
<p>6-7 (2-7) 6-2</p>
<p>2-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Tomas Nydahl (Sweden) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
